### 1. Add book (through gateway)
POST http://localhost:9000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code", "author": "Robert C. Martin", "isbn": "9780132350884" }

### 2. View all books
GET http://localhost:9000/api/books

### 3. View one book
GET http://localhost:9000/api/books/1

### 4. Update book
PUT http://localhost:9000/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code (2nd Print)", "author": "Robert C. Martin", "isbn": "9780132350884" }

### 5. Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:9000/api/books/1

### 6. INVALID: blank title + bad ISBN -> 400
POST http://localhost:9000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "author": "X", "isbn": "123" }

### 7. INVALID: duplicate ISBN -> 409 (run request 1 twice)

### 8. INVALID: id not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:9000/api/books/9999

### 9. INVALID: id not a number -> 400
GET http://localhost:9000/api/books/abc

### 10. INVALID: malformed JSON -> 400
POST http://localhost:9000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Oops",
